window.bookSummaryJSON = "Years ago he tried to break me.<br>In some ways he succeeded. I'm still learning how to survive.<br><br>After a brutal attack lands me in the hospital, the past I buried claws its way back to the surface—bringing memories of violence, captivity, and a pain so deep it still owns pieces of me. I thought I'd learned how to live with the damage. I was wrong.<br><br>Because healing doesn't begin until <i>they </i>step into my life.<br><br>Five men.<br>Five very different kinds of protection.<br>None of them see me as fragile.<br><br>They don't try to erase what was done to me. They don't pretend the darkness doesn't exist. Instead, they stand beside me while I learn how to breathe again—how to feel safe, how to want, how to trust.<br><br>But the past doesn't stay buried forever.<br><br>When the man who shattered me comes back, I'm forced to confront a terrifying truth: loving these men gives me something worth fighting for... and something my enemies can take.<br><br>This is not a story about being saved.<br>It's about surviving—and choosing to live anyway.<br><br><b>Broken Soul</b> is the first book in a dark reverse harem series with ongoing storylines and emotional cliffhangers. Healing is slow. Trauma is not sanitized. Love is hard-won.<br><br>CONTENT WARNING: This book contains graphic depictions of sexual assault, physical and emotional violence, animal abuse, and psychological trauma. Please read with care. I don’t want anyone to be harmed from the words I’ve written. If you or someone you know needs help, please know you’re worth it! National Abuse Hotline 800-799-SAFE"; 
